---
title: "What Makes Agent Cortex Different"
scope: global
---
graph LR
    subgraph TYPICAL["Typical AI Agent"]
        direction TB
        A1["Receives a task"]
        A2["Generates output"]
        A3["Returns it"]
        A4["No memory of previous tasks"]
        A1 --> A2 --> A3
        A3 -.-> A4
    end

    subgraph CORTEX["Agent Cortex"]
        direction TB

        subgraph PLAN["Planning"]
            B1["Receives a project"]
            B2["Planner decomposes into<br/>task graph with dependencies"]
            B3["Basal Ganglia suppresses<br/>irrelevant senses"]
            B4["Norepinephrine sets arousal:<br/>how much attention each task gets"]
        end

        subgraph EXEC["Per-Task Execution (two nested loops)"]
            B5["Thalamus routes context<br/>from all brain regions"]
            B6["Senses consult — each<br/>with its own project memory"]
            B6b["Explore: generate divergent<br/>approaches before committing<br/>(skipped for routine tasks)"]
            B7["Motor Cortex: plans approach,<br/>builds, self-corrects mid-build"]
            B8["Evaluate from competing<br/>perspectives → resolve tensions"]
            B8b["Improvement potential?<br/>Senses re-consult after<br/>seeing actual work"]
        end

        subgraph LEARN["Learning Between Tasks"]
            B9["Working Memory tracks<br/>patterns + score trends"]
            B10["Dopamine: prediction error<br/>signals what to learn from"]
            B11["Hippocampus records episodes"]
            B11b["Crystallization: clusters<br/>episodes into principles"]
            B12["Basal Ganglia strengthens<br/>or weakens routines"]
            B13["Cerebellum calibrates<br/>predictions for next task"]
        end

        subgraph PARTNER["Human Partnership"]
            B14["Drift Monitor catches<br/>divergence from intent"]
            B15["Detects taste divergence:<br/>stated vs. demonstrated"]
            B16["Escalates low-confidence<br/>decisions at the right time"]
        end

        B1 --> B2 --> B3 --> B4
        B4 --> B5 --> B6 --> B6b --> B7 --> B8
        B8 -->|"inner loop: revise"| B7
        B8 --> B8b
        B8b -->|"outer loop: re-consult"| B6
        B8b --> B9 --> B10
        B10 --> B11 --> B11b
        B10 --> B12 & B13
        B11b --> B5
        B13 --> B5
        B12 -->|"routine? skip explore"| B6b
        B9 --> B14
        B14 --> B15
        B14 -->|"needs human input"| B16
        B16 --> B9
        B9 -->|"next task"| B5
    end

    classDef typical fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#999,color:#666
    classDef plan fill:#e3d5f0,stroke:#9b7dc4,color:#333
    classDef exec fill:#dae8fc,stroke:#6c8ebf,color:#333
    classDef learn fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656,color:#333
    classDef partner fill:#f5e6d3,stroke:#d4a574,color:#333
    classDef dead fill:#eee,stroke:#ccc,color:#999

    class A1,A2,A3 typical
    class A4 dead
    class B1,B2,B3,B4 plan
    class B5,B6,B6b,B7,B8 exec
    class B9,B10,B11,B11b,B12,B13 learn
    class B14,B15,B16 partner
